This image contains OpenVINO/Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct-int4-ov at revision
3ffb805d532a250e5010c5aa5ce6579e60b31d71 (https://huggingface.co/OpenVINO/Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct-int4-ov), an
INT4 OpenVINO IR conversion by Intel of Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct by the Qwen team at Alibaba Cloud
(https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct), unmodified, under the Apache License, Version 2.0,
